msgid "The Pilgrims of St. Nicholas"
msgstr "Hodočasnici svetog Nikole"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Aga's men took the pilgrims' money. Find little Luka and take them all home across the sea."
msgstr ""
"Agini ljudi su uzeli šolde hodočasnicima. {crew|Nađi|Nađi|Nađite} malega Luku i "
"{crew|vodi|vodi|vodite} sve doma priko mora."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The whole floor of Otranto cathedral is one huge mosaic, made in the 1160s by artists led by a "
"monk called Pantaleon, with a great Tree of Life running along it."
msgstr ""
"Cili pod katedrale u Otrantu je jedan veliki mozaik. Napravili su ga 1160-ih meštri pod vodstvon "
"redovnika Pantaleona, a priko njega se proteže veliko Stablo života."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pilgrims are home!"
msgstr "Hodočasnici su doma!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You found Luka and took the pilgrims home across the sea."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Naša si|Našla si|Našli ste|Našle ste} Luku i {crew|odveza|odvezla|odvezli|odvezle} "
"hodočasnike doma priko mora."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/09_pilgrims_of_st_nicholas/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "In Ragusa, the bells ring for them."
msgstr "U Dubrovniku in zvone zvona."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain! The corsairs of Ulcinj took all our olive oil."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Kapetane|Kapetanice|Kapetani|Kapetanice}! Gusari iz Ulcinja su nan uzeli svo maslinovo ulje."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "We traded it for the winter, and now we have nothing."
msgstr "Dobili smo ga u zaminu za zimu, a sad nimamo ništa."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Nobody fights them. Go and ask what they want for it!"
msgstr "Niko se s njima ne bije. {crew|Pođi i pitaj|Pođi i pitaj|Pođite i pitajte} ča oće za njega!"

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oil for oil? No, no. My sail is torn to rags."
msgstr "Ulje za ulje? Ne, ne. Idro mi je razderano u krpe."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me a new sail, and you get your oil back."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Donesi mi novo idro, pa ćeš|Donesi mi novo idro, pa ćeš|Donesite mi novo idro, pa ćete} "
"dobit ulje nazad."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The sailmaker of Durrës makes the best sails."
msgstr "Jidrar iz Drača šije najbolja idra."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A new sail! Fine work. Here is your oil, captain."
msgstr ""
"Novo idro! Lipo je napravljeno. Evo {crew|tvog|tvog|vašeg} ulja, "
"{crew|kapetane|kapetanice|kapetani|kapetanice}."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "And tell the Aga that Crooked Mast is not his friend."
msgstr "I {crew|reci|reci|recite} Agi da Krivi Jarbol ni njegov prijatelj."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A sail? Gladly, but my cough is so bad, I can not work."
msgstr "Idro? Rado, ma tako kašljen da ne moren radit."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Only the honey of Vlorë helps."
msgstr "Pomaže samo med iz Valone."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me a jar of honey!"
msgstr "{crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} mi lončić meda!"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey from Vlorë! My cough is gone already."
msgstr "Med iz Valone! Kašalj mi je već proša."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is the sail. The finest in the Adriatic!"
msgstr "Evo idra. Najlipše na cilon Jadranu!"

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey? My bees made plenty."
msgstr "Med? Moje pčele su ga napravile napretek."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But I need salt for my cheese. Do you have salt on board?"
msgstr "Ma triba mi sol za sir. {crew|Imaš|Imaš|Imate} li soli na brodu?"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salt! Just what I needed."
msgstr "Sol! Baš ča mi je tribalo."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here is a jar of my best honey."
msgstr "Evo lončića mog najboljeg meda."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the olive oil home to {port}."
msgstr "{crew|Vrati|Vrati|Vratite} maslinovo ulje doma, {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Our oil! Now we have enough for the winter."
msgstr "Naše ulje! Sad nan je dosta za zimu."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast sent a message, too:"
msgstr "Krivi Jarbol je posla i poruku:"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"The Aga's scribe sails south with a heavy book. Watch out for him!\""
msgstr "„Agin pisar jidri na jug s teškon knjigon. {crew|Pazi|Pazi|Pazite} se njega!”"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Corsairs of Ulcinj"
msgstr "Gusari iz Ulcinja"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The corsairs took the villages' olive oil. Find out what they want, and trade it back."
msgstr ""
"Gusari su uzeli maslinovo ulje iz sela. {crew|Doznaj|Doznaj|Doznajte} ča oće, pa ga "
"{crew|vrati|vrati|vratite} trampon."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The olive trees of the Adriatic grow very old: near Bar in Montenegro stands an olive tree which "
"is said to be more than two thousand years old."
msgstr ""
"Masline na Jadranu žive jako dugo: kod Bara u Crnoj Gori raste maslina za koju se govori da ima "
"više od dvi iljade godin."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oil is home!"
msgstr "Ulje je doma!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not a single shot was fired: a sail, a jar of honey and a sack of salt did it."
msgstr "Nije bilo ni jednega hica: sve su učinili idro, lončić meda i vrića soli."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/10_corsairs_of_ulcinj/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Even the corsair captain is your friend now."
msgstr "Čak je i gusarski kapetan sad {crew|tvoj|tvoj|vaš} prijatelj."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the Aga wants the oranges of Parga as a tax!"
msgstr "{crew|Kapetane|Kapetanice|Kapetani|Kapetanice}, Aga oće naranče iz Parge ka porez!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eleni of Parga hid the harvest from his men."
msgstr "Eleni iz Parge je sakrila berbu od njegovih ljudi."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Help her get the oranges to the market of Corfu, so that the money stays with the people."
msgstr "{crew|Pomozi|Pomozi|Pomozite} joj odnit naranče na pazar na Krfu, da šoldi ostanu puku."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oranges are ripe, but the Aga's men broke all my baskets."
msgstr "Naranče su zrile, ali Agini ljudi su mi razbili sve koše."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring me baskets! Ilir of Vlorë weaves the best ones."
msgstr "{crew|Donesi|Donesi|Donesite} mi koše! Najbolje plete Ilir iz Valone."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fine baskets! Here are the oranges, captain."
msgstr "Lipi koši! Evo naranača, {crew|kapetane|kapetanice|kapetani|kapetanice}."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Smell them: the sun of Parga is inside."
msgstr "{crew|Pomiriši|Pomiriši|Pomirišite} ih: unutra je sunce iz Parge."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I weave baskets from the reeds of the lagoon."
msgstr "Ja pletem koše od trske iz lagune."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "But my boat lost its rope. Spiros in Corfu has ropes!"
msgstr "Ali moja barka je ostala bez konopa. Spiros na Krfu ima konope!"

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good rope! Here are my baskets."
msgstr "Dobar konop! Koši su {crew|tvoji|tvoji|vaši}."

#. what a person in a chain of trades wants, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A rope for Ilir? The harbour of Corfu has ropes for everybody."
msgstr "Konop za Ilira? Port na Krfu ima konope za svakega."

#. what a person says after a trade, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Take this one, captain."
msgstr "{crew|Uzmi|Uzmi|Uzmite} ovi, {crew|kapetane|kapetanice|kapetani|kapetanice}."

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the oranges to the market of {port}."
msgstr "{crew|Odnesi|Odnesi|Odnesite} naranče na pazar, {port@to}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oranges from Parga! The whole market smells of them."
msgstr "Naranče iz Parge! Cili pazar miriše po njima."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The money goes to the people of Parga, not to the Aga."
msgstr "Šoldi gredu puku iz Parge, a ne Agi."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every orange was sold, and Parga keeps its money."
msgstr "Sve naranče su prodane, a šoldi su ostali u Pargi."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga gets only the peels!"
msgstr "Agi ostaju samo kore!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Oranges of Parga"
msgstr "Naranče iz Parge"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Aga wants the oranges of Parga as a tax. Trade your way to baskets and bring the oranges to "
"the market of Corfu."
msgstr ""
"Aga oće naranče iz Parge ka porez. {crew|Minjaj dok ne dobiješ koše i odnesi|Minjaj dok ne dobiješ"
" koše i odnesi|Minjajte dok ne dobijete koše i odnesite} naranče na pazar na Krfu."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Parga was a little Venetian town on the Greek coast for almost 400 years, with Ottoman lands all "
"around it, and it was often raided by its neighbours."
msgstr ""
"Parga je skoro 400 godin bila mali mletački gradić na grčkoj obali. Okolo su bile osmanske zemlje,"
" a susidi su je često napadali."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sweet oranges for Corfu!"
msgstr "Slatke naranče za Krf!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The oranges reached the market, and the money stayed in Parga."
msgstr "Naranče su stigle na pazar, a šoldi su ostali u Pargi."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/11_oranges_of_parga/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "A rope, a basket and a lot of sailing did it."
msgstr "Konop, koš i puno jidrenja, i gotovo!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, the warning of Crooked Mast came true!"
msgstr "{crew|Kapetane|Kapetanice|Kapetani|Kapetanice}, Krivi Jarbol je ima pravo!"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's scribe was here with a heavy book: the ledger of the double taxes."
msgstr "Agin pisar je bija tu s teškon knjigon: to je knjiga duplih poreza."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "With it, we can prove everything. But he fled in a hurry. Chase him!"
msgstr "S njon moremo sve dokazat. Ma pobiga je na brzinu. {crew|Juri|Juri|Jurite} ga!"

#. a clue; {hallmark} is a noun phrase like 'a patched red sail'
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The scribe had {hallmark}."
msgstr "Pisar je ima {hallmark@acc}."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Have you seen the Aga's scribe with a heavy book?"
msgstr "Jeste li vidili Aginog pisara s teškon knjigon?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is here, hiding among the people of the harbour! But which one is he?"
msgstr "Tu je, skriva se među ljudima u portu! Ma koji je od njih?"

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is the Aga's scribe?"
msgstr "Koji je Agin pisar?"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not the scribe! Remember all four things you learned."
msgstr ""
"Ne, to ni pisar! {crew|Misli na sva četiri znaka ča si dozna|Misli na sva četiri znaka ča si "
"doznala|Mislite na sva četiri znaka ča ste doznali|Mislite na sva četiri znaka ča ste doznale}."

#. a line after the right pick
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"Alright, alright! Here is the ledger. I only wrote what the Aga told me!\""
msgstr "„Dobro, dobro! Evo knjige. Ja san samo pisa ča mi je Aga reka!”"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"I will tell the truth before the judge, I promise.\""
msgstr "„Reć ću istinu pred sucen, obećajen.”"

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ledger proves it: the Aga took every tax twice!"
msgstr "Knjiga to dokazuje: Aga je svaki porez uzima dvaput!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Forged Ledger"
msgstr "Krivotvorena knjiga"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Aga's scribe flees with the ledger of the double taxes. Chase him along the coast!"
msgstr "Agin pisar biži s knjigon duplih poreza. {crew|Juri|Juri|Jurite} ga duž obale!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Spectacles were made in Venice from about 1300 on; the glassmakers of Murano were so precious that"
" they were not allowed to leave the republic."
msgstr ""
"Očali su se u Veneciji pravili otprilike od 1300. godine. Staklari s Murana bili su toliko vridni "
"da nisu smili otić iz republike."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ledger is yours!"
msgstr "Knjiga je {crew|tvoja|tvoja|vaša}!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "You chased the scribe along the whole coast and found him."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Jurija si|Jurila si|Jurili ste|Jurile ste} pisara duž cile obale i {crew|naša si|našla "
"si|našli ste|našle ste} ga."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/12_forged_ledger/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the crew holds the proof of the double taxes."
msgstr "Sad posada ima dokaz za duple poreze."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Captain, I must confess something."
msgstr "{crew|Kapetane|Kapetanice|Kapetani|Kapetanice}, moran {crew|ti|ti|van} nešto priznat."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I wrote the list of the villages in the old Glagolitic letters, so that the Aga could not read it."
msgstr "Popis sela san napisa staron glagoljicon, da ga Aga ne more pročitat."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now I can not read it either! Find a priest who knows the old letters."
msgstr "A sad ga ni ja ne moren pročitat! {crew|Nađi|Nađi|Nađite} popa ča zna stara slova."

#. a clue; {hallmark} is a noun phrase like 'a patched red sail'
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The priest has {hallmark}."
msgstr "Pop ima {hallmark@acc}."

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Have you seen a priest who knows the old letters?"
msgstr "Jeste li vidili popa ča zna stara slova?"

#. a line in the last port of a trail
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don Grgur is here, at the market! But which one is he?"
msgstr "Don Grgur je tu, na pazaru! Ali koji je on?"

#. what the crew asks, or what the crew is asked
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which one is Don Grgur? Remember what the people told you!"
msgstr "Koji je don Grgur? {crew|Siti se|Siti se|Sitite se} ča su {crew|ti|ti|van} ljudi rekli!"

#. a line after a wrong pick
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "No, that is not him! Think of all three things you learned."
msgstr ""
"Ne, to nije on! {crew|Misli na sve tri stvari ča si čuja|Misli na sve tri stvari ča si "
"čula|Mislite na sve tri stvari ča ste čuli|Mislite na sve tri stvari ča ste čule}."

#. a line after the right pick
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"Yes, I read the old letters. Let me see... every village, and every ducat!\""
msgstr "„Da, ja štijen stara slova. Da vidimo... svako selo i svaki dukat!”"

#. the objective while sailing, on the banner
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bring the list back to the scribe in {port}."
msgstr "{crew|Vrati|Vrati|Vratite} popis pisaru {port@in}."

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Every village and every ducat, written clearly at last!"
msgstr "Svako selo i svaki dukat, napokon napisani jasno!"

#. a line of thanks, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the judge can give back every coin."
msgstr "Sad sudac more vratit svaki šold."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The list is ready for the judge."
msgstr "Popis je spreman za suca."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "I will never write in a secret script again!"
msgstr "Nikad više neću pisat tajnin pismon!"

#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Secret Script"
msgstr "Tajno pismo"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The list of the villages is written in old Glagolitic letters. Find a priest who can read it."
msgstr "Popis sela je napisan staron glagoljicon. {crew|Nađi|Nađi|Nađite} popa ča ga more pročitat."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Glagolitic is the oldest known Slavic alphabet. On the islands of Kvarner, like Krk, and on the "
"islands near Zadar, Croatian priests and scribes kept writing in it for centuries."
msgstr ""
"Glagoljica je najstarije poznato slavensko pismo. Na kvarnerskin otocima, ka na Krku, i na otocima"
" kod Zadra, hrvatski popi i pisari su njon pisali vikovima."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The list is read!"
msgstr "Popis je pročitan!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Don Grgur read the old letters for you."
msgstr "Don Grgur {crew|ti|ti|van} je pročita stara slova."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/13_secret_script/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now the judge will know every village and every ducat."
