#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/14_the_witnesses/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Crooked Mast in Ulcinj, Mustafa in Castelnuovo and Jele in Kotor saw what the Aga's men did."
